00:46:31,671 --> 00:46:40,850
Speaker 1: It's can you recognize the pattern right on this, this tree of possibilities and you can influence the path.

692
00:46:41,151 --> 00:46:44,707
Speaker 1: And can you influence the path to a winning path or not?

693
00:46:45,930 --> 00:46:56,850
Speaker 0: And it's interesting because many games that humans historically have seen across many cultures as long standing or important or culturally significant games.

694
00:46:57,211 --> 00:47:05,310
